  "title": "4. RISK MANAGEMENT:",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-13-004\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24376]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>4. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>RISK MANAGEMENT:</strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24377]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Healthcare is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>considered to</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> be </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>the </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>most complex industry in the world. Despite major efforts, acute admission to hospital still </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>retains</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> a 10% chance of an adverse event. There remains a magnitude of difference in the reliability of healthcare processes when compared to processes within the airline industry or nuclear industry.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24378]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Risk is the uncertainty surrounding events and their outcomes. All our activities carry some risk and risk is inherent in every activity.\u00a0</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll mm-table-floating-reflow\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" data-mm-tblp-left-from-text=\"180\" data-mm-tblp-right-from-text=\"180\" data-mm-tblp-vert-anchor=\"text\" data-mm-tblp-horz-anchor=\"margin\" data-mm-tblp-x-spec=\"center\" data-mm-tblp-y=\"573\" style=\"clear:both;margin-left:9pt;margin-right:9pt;\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:577.5pt;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0.75pt;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:315.5pt;\"><col style=\"width:262pt;\"></colgroup><thead><tr data-mm-row-cell-spacing-twips=\"15\" data-mm-row-cell-spacing-unit=\"dxa\"><th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:#DEE9EE;vertical-align:middle;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;border-left:none;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#416D81;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Questions addressed by risk management</span></p></th></tr><tr data-mm-row-cell-spacing-twips=\"15\" data-mm-row-cell-spacing-unit=\"dxa\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:#DEE9EE;vertical-align:bottom;border-top:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-right:none;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#001747;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Question</strong></span></p></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:#DEE9EE;vertical-align:bottom;border-top:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-right:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#001747;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Answer</strong></span></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-mm-row-cell-spacing-twips=\"15\" data-mm-row-cell-spacing-unit=\"dxa\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>What could go (or went) wrong?</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Risk identification</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-cell-spacing-twips=\"15\" data-mm-row-cell-spacing-unit=\"dxa\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>What are the chances of it going wrong and what would be the impact?</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Risk analysis and evaluation</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-cell-spacing-twips=\"15\" data-mm-row-cell-spacing-unit=\"dxa\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>What can we do to minimise the chance of this happening or to mitigate damage when it has gone wrong?</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Risk treatment - the cost of prevention is compared with the cost of getting it wrong</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-cell-spacing-twips=\"15\" data-mm-row-cell-spacing-unit=\"dxa\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>What can we learn from things that have gone wrong?</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:none;border-right:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;border-left:0.75pt solid #7DA9BD;padding-top:0.75pt;padding-right:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;padding-left:0.75pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color:#222222;font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Risk control; sharing and learning</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24379]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Basic questions addressed by risk management:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24380]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24381]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24382]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>There is no clear demarcation between clinical (e.g. medication error) and non-clinical (e.g. falls off a trolley) risk management and it is preferable to take a holistic view of patient safety. However, strategies to prevent errors happening again may have the same or different pathways.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24383]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>This remains a basic framework to begin examination of an incident.\u00a0Typically, actions should be considered across 3 levels.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24384]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>How engaged are you in your unit's risk management program</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24385]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>How many patient safety incidents have you been involved with in the last 6 months?</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24386]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In how many of these incidents did you complete an incident form? What happened to the form and what feedback did you receive?</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24387]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24388]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24389]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24390]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24391]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24392]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Risk register</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24393]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.All risks should have an action plan</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24394]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2.Each unit should have risk register best in electronic form</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24395]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3.Shortage of staff and equipment must be mentioned in register before starting the shift</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24396]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24397]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Root cause analysis</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24398]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.identify incident and take decision to investigate </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24399]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2.select members of investigation team</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24400]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3.gather data (record, interview, protocols)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24401]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4.determine chronology of incidents</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24402]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5.identify care delivery problems (unsafe act, failure to act, incorrect decision)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24403]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6.identify contributing factors (lack of supervision, inadequate training)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24404]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>7.device an action plan</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"9490a14a00e8065c2eb42f6f\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-13-004\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 9490a14a00e8065c2eb42f6f\" viewbox=\"0 0 3209925 2628900\" p